    "next": {
      "organisation_leg": "the same city runs an organisation lottery and an organisation auction alongside these two, with its own indicator policy; that doubles the object and gives a cross-leg comparison inside one city-month. It is cleaner than two halves of one win rate and it is not clean: a company car and a personally bought plate are substitutes, so the two pools' demands are linked, and the data separates who bid where without separating why anyone was absent from the other pool",
