      "population_is_not_a_margin": "the indifference condition presumes someone trading off paying now against waiting, and purchase timing on this carrier is set by when a car is wanted; entering a free lottery costs almost nothing, so the denominator counts people who took a free option rather than people who want a plate this period, and the same person is a waiter in one period and a buyer in the next. An exogenous denominator would still not be the wait the condition needs",
